320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring7.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring7.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring7.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring8.jpg?resize=680%2C680&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring8.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring8.jpg?resize=320%2C320&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring8.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring8.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring8.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring9.jpg?resize=680%2C680&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"680\" height=\"680\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring9.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring9.jpg?resize=320%2C320&amp;ssl=1 320w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring9.jpg?resize=600%2C600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring9.jpg?resize=240%2C240&amp;ssl=1 240w, https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/refiguring9.jpg?resize=768%2C768&amp;ssl=1 768w\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/r